.TH QTESTDISK 8 @TESTDISKDATE@ "Administration Tools"
.SH NAME
qtestdisk \- Qt front-end for TestDisk, find and recover lost partitions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.BI "qtestdisk
.SH DESCRIPTION
   \fBQTestDisk\fP is a graphical front-end for \fBtestdisk\fP(8). It lists the disks, or opens a disk image, runs the TestDisk Quick Search or Deeper Search and shows the partitions found. After confirmation, it can write the recovered partition table to the disk.
   QTestDisk runs \fBtestdisk /cmd\fP, so the \fBtestdisk\fP program must be installed next to \fBqtestdisk\fP or in the PATH. Partition statuses cannot be changed from QTestDisk; use \fBtestdisk\fP(8) for this and for the advanced filesystem utilities.
   For more information on how to use, please visit the wiki pages on www.cgsecurity.org
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR testdisk (8),
.BR qphotorec (8),
.BR fdisk (8).
.BR
.SH AUTHOR
QTestDisk @VERSION@, Data Recovery Utility, @TESTDISKDATE@
